{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國國家網絡安全中心（NCSC）近日發佈警告稱，英國關鍵基礎設施運營方必須儘快為下一代網絡攻擊做好準備。該機構預計，到2028年前後，由人工智能驅動的惡意軟件和勒索軟件攻擊將成為現實威脅，而大量仍在使用老舊系統的組織可能成為重點目標。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584834.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:43:23.215812+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:36:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:38:55.410609+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:38:55.410609+00:00","content_hash":"d8b24ca7075161af4e5968bdb2efd9400c34902c691362aa2ecde83f2823b938","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}